node_modules
dist
*.log

# Generated by `make -C go test`: machine-specific workspace pointing at
# the omni/sekreto sibling checkouts (the sekreto convention).
go/go.work
go/go.work.sum

# Per-port build output and caches (each port builds locally; nothing
# under these is source).
rust/target
rust/vendor
java/target
java/*.jar
# Compiled output. This was NOT ignored, so 46 .class files were tracked -
# including 24 of voxgig/sekreto's, under build/fatjar. `make build`
# regenerates all of it from source, and every other port already ignores
# its own build output.
java/build
__pycache__/
*.pyc
c/build
cpp/build
# csharp/bin and csharp/obj matched NOTHING: dotnet writes its output
# beside the project file, so the paths are csharp/src/bin, csharp/src/obj,
# csharp/test/bin and csharp/test/obj. `make -C csharp clean` removes
# exactly those four.
csharp/*/bin
csharp/*/obj
swift/.build
dart/.dart_tool
elixir/_build
elixir/deps
*.o
swift/vendor
